63c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用叶翰林韵题赵叔问燕文贵山林","author":"程俱","text":"列岫轩窗五柳门，瀼西林谷渭南村。\n一区正欲寻幽处，指点丹青得细论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3168,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬子七月十六日夜月蚀五首 其一","author":"程俱","text":"青天那得虾蟆窟，白地空忧虮虱臣。\n坐待煤炱露残魄，十分寒玉涌秋旻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3169,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬子七月十六日夜月蚀五首 其二","author":"程俱","text":"阿脩罗王手所障，卢祛虱吒心定知。\n一念多生人我垢，能令天眼作昏眵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3170,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬子七月十六日夜月蚀五首 其三","author":"程俱","text":"怪发玻瓈塌死灰，食馀明镜挂高台。\n撒沙星出争光大，不易青莲火里开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3171,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬子七月十六日夜月蚀五首 其四","author":"程俱","text":"撑肠挂肚何繇足，持腋持颐可自娱。\n底事缘天得刳磔，未妨璧月照空虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3172,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬子七月十六日夜月蚀五首 其五","author":"程俱","text":"烂银盘从海东出，云楼半开壁斜白。\n时有幽人自往来，兰佩相逢桂香陌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3173,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":