7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄彦文","author":"程俱","text":"踵息庵前草又青，庵中禅客养黄庭。\n起来何物共吟啸，照眼云山锦翠屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3180,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得叔问书报柳元礼许寄鹤二首 其一","author":"程俱","text":"海上胎禽雪翅翎，故人千里念岩扃。\n崇兰馆近光音坞，为予新添放鹤亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3181,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得叔问书报柳元礼许寄鹤二首 其二","author":"程俱","text":"北山林沼久荒凉，正要仙禽借宠光。\n为报携笼须问道，直防妖鸟嚇鸾凰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3182,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣兴二首 其一","author":"程俱","text":"膏肓二竖能为害，肠胃三虫不姓彭。\n安得此身无一事，林间耳目也清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3183,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣兴二首 其二","author":"程俱","text":"但见虚空昏又晓，也知身世老还衰。\n须乘般若超三界，有底穷通比四时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3184,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄潜老求菊栽","author":"程俱","text":"东篱终日对南山，三径荒芜十亩宽。\n正欲秋英媚幽独，可令霜鬣苦高寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3185,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过徐节之宅有感三首 其一","author":"程俱","text":"颐庆堂成未一年，窗中紫翠列千山。\n重来前日持杯地，桃李飘零春自阑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3186,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过徐节之宅有感三首 其二","author":"程俱","text":"市骏不应遗泛驾，更刀犹足中桑林。\n故知老骥思千里，未害鸱夷致万金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3187,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过徐节之宅有感三首 其三","author":"程俱","text":"游倦归来老境侵，炎凉薄俗见升沉。\n东阡北陌追游处，独对春风泪满襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3188,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦雨","author":"程俱","text":"一夜溪流涨几竿，还惊四月雨声寒。\n灶生蛙黾木生耳，谁信句吴有漏天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3189,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事呈叔问 其一","author":"程俱","text":"召节蒲轮走四方，眼看浮俗变炎凉。\n升沉变化那知许，但觉琳宫气味长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3190,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事呈叔问 其二","author":"程俱","text":"五年香火奉殊庭，愚蠢衰残得此生。\n不解常山无一事，也纫兰佩解尘缨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3191,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄彦文仲长","author":"程俱","text":"踵息华光信绝尘，黄芽白雪镇长新。\n仙翁抱朴仍宗好，好趁丹台八伯人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3192,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言属叔问","author":"程俱","text":"崇兰一日千里，长寿三年不飞。\n颓惰无人似我，精坚似子诚稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3193,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺仲长得子","author":"程俱","text":"华光深閟养黄芽，又见婴儿继女牙。\n好赋梦熊诗百首，年年持赠老仙家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3194,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"程俱","text":"鱼鼓铿铿惊睡昏，披衣兀坐了无言。\n扫除浮念都灰冷，紫府昆崙寄默存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3195,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李泰发雪中见过有绝句次日会叔问舍和酬三首 其一","author":"程俱","text":"一觞相属对江梅，玉麈清谈得重陪。\n不似稽山寻贺老，越溪空掉酒船回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3196,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李泰发雪中见过有绝句次日会叔问舍和酬三首 其二","author":"程俱","text":"幽寒长似北枝梅，鹓鹭英游不再陪。\n邂逅故人成一笑，衰颜华发觉春回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3197,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李泰发雪中见过有绝句次日会叔问舍和酬三首 其三","author":"程俱","text":"二公才业尽台莱，并辔天衢昔屡陪。\n自笑摧颓无复理，寸心衰谢等寒灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3198,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"何瞻圣博士兖新年八十口号奉和三首 其一","author":"程俱","text":"悬弧嘉祐太平年，寿帙行开第九编。\n可但天公锡难老，枣梨仙树植三田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3199,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"何瞻圣博士兖新年八十口号奉和三首 其二","author":"程俱","text":"漆书行复开藏壁，金版方思得钓璜。\n何似悬车无一事，逍遥尘表寿而康。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3200,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"何瞻圣博士兖新年八十口号奉和三首 其三","author":"程俱","text":"四朝冠盖三更变，万国兵戈百战场。\n屈指乡闾数耆旧，几人能似鲁灵光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3201,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶观乐天酬杨八绝句有慨于心者因追和赠叔问","author":"程俱","text":"老壮荣衰才命别，如何同作侍祠官。\n几春桃李开还落，赢得闲人冷地看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3202,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓝舆行清辉门外即事","author":"程俱","text":"映日梅花雪不如，清溪一曲抱城隅。\n何时五亩开三径，负郭临溪寄一区。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":3203,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新正未得与彦文相见聊寄二绝句为寿 其一","author":"程俱","text":"燕处超然老复丁，等闲高树脱尘缨。\n知君已悟长生理，不作容成作广成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/P